Description: A fast, correct and safe jpeg decoder

Local Modifications:
- Backport raw iMCU and scanline decoding.
- Carry a single local port of the final raw-input, accurate IDCT, progressive
  block-smoothing, and raw-publication fixes proposed in
  https://github.com/etemesi254/zune-image/pull/494.
  Preserve existing best-effort packed and scanline decoding.
